# data lake and database. Rebuildable from upstream + code, EXCEPT the two datasets whose upstream
# history is lossy: our daily injury snapshots and odds-feed snapshots. Those are small and tracked.
data/snapshots/*
!data/snapshots/nflverse/
data/snapshots/nflverse/*
!data/snapshots/nflverse/injuries/
!data/snapshots/odds_api/
data/db/
data/cache/
!data/metadata/

